OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after 10-year battle
OL,4,Ato mend sinkhole
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road in a Lincolnshire village has
OL,7,Ffinally reopened after a 10-year battle
OL,8,Fto repair a sinkhole which kept
OL,9,Freappearing.
OL,11,FThe latest round of repair work started
OL,12,Fon the site on Enterprise Way in
OL,13,FPinchbeck near Spalding in June.
OL,15,FAshley Behan, traffic manager at
OL,16,FLincolnshire County Council, said the
OL,17,Fauthority had worked with Anglian Water
OL,18,F"to fully investigate the root causes
OL,19,Frather than simply carry out another
OL,20,Fshort-term repair".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
