OL,3,GNEWSARoad reopens after 10-year battle
OL,4,Ato mend sinkhole
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These works have gone on for longer
OL,7,Fthan anyone would have wanted and I'd
OL,8,Flike to apologise for the disruption
OL,9,Fcaused, particularly to local
OL,10,Fbusinesses and residents," he said,
OL,11,Fadding the council was "now confident
OL,12,Fthe underlying issues have been
OL,13,Faddressed".
